  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrapper for the `opengrep` CLI. Pattern-based SAST scanner forked from Semgrep with cleaner licensing (multi-vendor governance, no Pro paywall). Defaults to SARIF output because the Wave 1 chain (DefectDojo) consumes SARIF. Unpinned name (no .V{N} suffix) per ADR 0002 — OpenGrep was forked at 1.x with no prior 0.x to break compat with, and the project is committed to surface stability; if a future major breaks the wrapper this will be re-pinned as Tamp.OpenGrep.VN.",
